    "updated_at": "2017-09-06T18:33:51Z",
    "body": "For wpt we'd want to link to at least html/ and \"ongoing work\" on the html label, but probably also some other directories like 2dcontext and their labels.\r\n\r\nWhen adding things, you have to pay attention to how many boxes there are, their colors and making it look OK, and that kept me from touching them at least.\r\n\r\nDo you like it specifically because it makes HTML different, or would you want to make other specs more like HTML?",
